# Both repo-root build contexts (deploy/Dockerfile, deploy/sandbox/Dockerfile)
# `COPY . .` and need only Go sources + in-repo deploy scripts. Everything
# below is local machine state that bloats the context.
.git
.claude
bin
**/node_modules
# gitignored tool caches (ollama model blobs alone are ~4.5 GB; a context
# that copies them can fill a small host's disk before the compile starts)
**/.tools
build
